#: ../../general/Ms_description/process/process_bpmn/process_bpmn_unit_tests.rst:4
msgid "Тестирование BPMN-процессов"
msgstr "Testing BPMN processes"

#: ../../general/Ms_description/process/process_bpmn/process_bpmn_unit_tests.rst:7
msgid "Содержание"
msgstr "Contents"

#: ../../general/Ms_description/process/process_bpmn/process_bpmn_unit_tests.rst:10
msgid "Тестирование реализаций бизнес процессов BPMN"
msgstr "Testing BPMN Business Process Implementations"

#: ../../general/Ms_description/process/process_bpmn/process_bpmn_unit_tests.rst:12
msgid ""
"В ecos-process процессы и компоненты Citeck проверяются сценариями, "
"которые развёртывают BPMN-модель, запускают процесс и проверяют задачи, "
"переменные и результат исполнения."
msgstr "In ecos-process, Citeck processes and components are tested using scenarios that deploy a BPMN model, start a process and verify tasks, variables and execution results."

#: ../../general/Ms_description/process/process_bpmn/process_bpmn_unit_tests.rst:14
msgid ""
"Ниже описан способ тестирования в проекте ecos-process. Показанный пример"
" использует Spring-контекст приложения и движок Camunda, поэтому имеет "
"интеграционный характер."
msgstr "The following describes testing within the ecos-process project. The example uses the application Spring context and Camunda engine, making it an integration test."

#: ../../general/Ms_description/process/process_bpmn/process_bpmn_unit_tests.rst:16
msgid "Для сценариев и проверок используются библиотеки Camunda:"
msgstr "The following Camunda libraries are used for scenarios and assertions:"

#: ../../general/Ms_description/process/process_bpmn/process_bpmn_unit_tests.rst:18
msgid ""
"https://github.com/camunda-community-hub/camunda-platform-scenario - "
"написание unit тестов по стилю `GivenWhenThen "
"<https://martinfowler.com/bliki/GivenWhenThen.html>`_"
msgstr ""
"https://github.com/camunda-community-hub/camunda-platform-scenario - "
"writing unit tests in the `GivenWhenThen "
"<https://martinfowler.com/bliki/GivenWhenThen.html>`_ style"

#: ../../general/Ms_description/process/process_bpmn/process_bpmn_unit_tests.rst:19
msgid ""
"https://github.com/camunda/camunda-bpm-platform/tree/master/test-"
"utils/assert - удобные bpmn ассерты для тестов"
msgstr ""
"https://github.com/camunda/camunda-bpm-platform/tree/master/test-"
"utils/assert - convenient BPMN assertions for tests"

#: ../../general/Ms_description/process/process_bpmn/process_bpmn_unit_tests.rst:22
msgid "Тестирование Citeck компонентов BPMN"
msgstr "Testing Citeck BPMN Components"

#: ../../general/Ms_description/process/process_bpmn/process_bpmn_unit_tests.rst:24
msgid ""
"Тесты написанные для проверки Citeck компонентов bpmn представляют собой "
"небольшие процессы BPMN, которые реализуют варианты использования Citeck "
"компонентов, с дальнейшем запуском процесса и проверкой результатов."
msgstr ""
"Tests written to verify Citeck BPMN components consist of small BPMN "
"processes that implement use cases for Citeck components, followed by "
"running the process and verifying the results."

#: ../../general/Ms_description/process/process_bpmn/process_bpmn_unit_tests.rst:26
msgid ""
"Kotlin-тесты находятся в "
"``src/test/java/ru/citeck/ecos/process/domain/bpmn/`` и тематических "
"подкаталогах. BPMN-ресурсы компонентов располагаются в "
"``src/test/resources/test/bpmn/elements/``. Для сценариев используется "
"стиль `GivenWhenThen "
"<https://martinfowler.com/bliki/GivenWhenThen.html>`_."
msgstr "Kotlin tests are in ``src/test/java/ru/citeck/ecos/process/domain/bpmn/`` and topic subdirectories. Component BPMN resources are in ``src/test/resources/test/bpmn/elements/``. Scenarios use `GivenWhenThen <https://martinfowler.com/bliki/GivenWhenThen.html>`_ style."

#: ../../general/Ms_description/process/process_bpmn/process_bpmn_unit_tests.rst:28
msgid ""
"Пример назначения задачи по ролям находится в классе "
"``BpmnMonsterTestWithRunProcessTest``, метод ``task assignment by "
"roles``. Его BPMN-модель — "
"``src/test/resources/test/bpmn/elements/usertask/test-user-task-"
"role.bpmn.xml``."
msgstr "The role-based task assignment example is in ``BpmnMonsterTestWithRunProcessTest``, method ``task assignment by roles``. Its BPMN model is ``src/test/resources/test/bpmn/elements/usertask/test-user-task-role.bpmn.xml``."

#: ../../general/Ms_description/process/process_bpmn/process_bpmn_unit_tests.rst:31
msgid "Пример сценарного теста BPMN"
msgstr "Example BPMN scenario test"

#: ../../general/Ms_description/process/process_bpmn/process_bpmn_unit_tests.rst:33
msgid "Проверка назначения userTask по роли."
msgstr "Verifying userTask assignment by role."

