msgid "Процесс:"
msgstr "Process:"

#: ../../general/Ms_description/process/process_bpmn/process_bpmn_unit_tests.rst:41
msgid "Фрагмент теста из подготовленного окружения:"
msgstr "Test snippet from a prepared environment:"

#: ../../general/Ms_description/process/process_bpmn/process_bpmn_unit_tests.rst:43
msgid "Назначение задачи по ролям"
msgstr "Role-based task assignment"

#: ../../general/Ms_description/process/process_bpmn/process_bpmn_unit_tests.rst:65
msgid ""
"Класс использует ``@SpringBootTest`` с ``EprocApp`` и расширение "
"``EcosSpringExtension``. Вне показанного метода подготавливаются:"
msgstr "The class uses ``@SpringBootTest`` with ``EprocApp`` and ``EcosSpringExtension``. The following are prepared outside the shown method:"

#: ../../general/Ms_description/process/process_bpmn/process_bpmn_unit_tests.rst:67
msgid "``helper`` типа ``BpmnProcHelper`` для сохранения и деплоя модели;"
msgstr "``helper`` of type ``BpmnProcHelper`` for saving and deploying the model;"

#: ../../general/Ms_description/process/process_bpmn/process_bpmn_unit_tests.rst:68
msgid "``processEngine`` — экземпляр движка Camunda;"
msgstr "``processEngine``: a Camunda engine instance;"

#: ../../general/Ms_description/process/process_bpmn/process_bpmn_unit_tests.rst:69
msgid "``process`` — mock сценария ``ProcessScenario``;"
msgstr "``process``: a ``ProcessScenario`` mock;"

#: ../../general/Ms_description/process/process_bpmn/process_bpmn_unit_tests.rst:70
msgid "``variables_docRef`` — переменные запуска со ссылкой на документ;"
msgstr "``variables_docRef``: start variables containing a document reference;"

#: ../../general/Ms_description/process/process_bpmn/process_bpmn_unit_tests.rst:71
msgid ""
"BPMN-ресурс ``USER_TASK``, пользователи, группы и данные для разрешения "
"ролей."
msgstr "The ``USER_TASK`` BPMN resource, users, groups and role resolution data."

#: ../../general/Ms_description/process/process_bpmn/process_bpmn_unit_tests.rst:73
msgid ""
"Этот фрагмент следует использовать вместе с настройкой класса теста. Он "
"проверяет кандидатов задачи — пользователей и группы, полученные из "
"ролей, — завершает **userTask** и проверяет достижение **endEvent**."
msgstr "Use this snippet with the test class setup. It checks task candidates, meaning users and groups resolved from roles, completes **userTask**, and verifies that **endEvent** is reached."

